{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "06ca8898c5ee17ed37d97489a03c9f79d22066cd46b342bd96299e5875034510", "ja": "美希、お疲れさま。\n衣装、やっぱり似合ってるな！", "zh": "美希，辛苦了。看来这套服装果然很适合你啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "a0513a52efd7e13ea8fc355e8e16699235624dd55c8e90895bc4fac794645ce2", "ja": "あはっ☆　ありがとうなの。\nミキもこの衣装、すっごくカワイイって思うな！", "zh": "啊哈☆谢谢你。美希也觉得这套服装超级可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "cf53bb875ce374fae4e508bf6c91ed2af3a5ca05005f198f81dfe2fcb29537ec", "ja": "やる気のスイッチ、いっぱい入っちゃった♪\nお仕事も、いっぱいがんばれるかも！", "zh": "干劲的开关，全都被打开了呢♪\n工作感觉也能加倍努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6d3ed2b8bf56571a84a6c37e766cc2e02f3555ef7bf0eed201e5a05f87a1767c", "ja": "それはよかった。チョコがコンセプトの企画だから、\n甘くてかわいい美希をみんなに見せてやろう！", "zh": "那太好了。既然是以巧克力为主题的企划，就把甜美可爱的美希展现给大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "23f56f215ecc29b9d399d050d29ea342bdfdd14cac3371a4246ce0abc02fa92f", "ja": "うんっ。みんなと、あと{$P$}に、\nいっぱい見せてあげるね。あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯！给大家，还有{$P$}，好好展示一下哦。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "4ae0e39d9e4736248e496eb66eb63064c8497d82fe549214aa6fcd167709b5e8", "ja": "あ、そういえばミキ、今日チョコもってきたの。\n{$P$}、一緒に食べる？", "zh": "啊，说起来，美希今天还带了巧克力来。\n{$P$}，要一起吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "176aa828c50eaabf586a5946971fb137e34aed06b37c94eda267d8d93dcdb414", "ja": "じゃあ貰おうかな……って、ちょっと待った。\n一緒にって、もしかして美希も食べるのか？", "zh": "那我就收下吧……等等，先等一下。\n你说一起吃，该不会美希也要吃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "609c11fb587a4f33f1834cf7d17940aef10f26427f1925514106c12209f2b0e3", "ja": "そうだよ？　ミキ、甘いもの食べたいし。\nどうかした？", "zh": "是啊？我想吃甜食嘛。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "140e244e6c088075e1f22439aac81b1ced8e21c2a751d6231cc7ea070090e704", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だとは思うけど、もし衣装が汚れると\n困るだろ？　一応、ちゃんと脱いでからにしような。", "zh": "不是，我觉得应该没问题，不过要是把演出服弄脏了就麻烦了，对吧？还是先好好脱下来再吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "ddae906d1b035ee9c75b846cb6c9755e4dc8142b227996b21cd2751140c24b78", "ja": "あ、そうだよね。手についたチョコとかで、\n汚しちゃったら大変だし。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。要是不小心被手上沾的巧克力之类弄脏了，那可就糟糕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a9af858c29363d89a8ae7a27a0301b8783833bb311bfe48c4cf4d415208c7dd", "ja": "でも、せっかくがんばって着たのに残念なの。\nミキ、スイッチオフになっちゃうかも……。", "zh": "可是，好不容易努力穿上的，真可惜啊。\n美希可能要关机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9e2a0a3b8bbf2b997c8f073b6e04772c8452a6720c00b211434b09d04a78f6d0", "ja": "それはまあ……\nまた着た時にオンにする方向で頼むよ。", "zh": "那就……\n下次再穿上的时候，拜托你把开关打开吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "b87e661abd1ed5d813a239c7d02b2c634ac52de4a73dd81603e772578d553f53", "ja": "はーい、なの。それじゃ{$P$}、\n脱ぐの、手伝ってくれる？", "zh": "好——，那{$P$}，能帮我脱下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1013_p", "source_sha256": "890bf205fb259601ece1fcce906bfabd7b7a1bf537e69b2c0d535f97e4a53af7", "ja": "わかった、ボタンはどこ……じゃない！\nダメダメ、脱ぐのもひとりで頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "好的，纽扣在哪……不对！\n不行不行，脱衣服也得自己努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "7c1e1cad038cff2d5bfe5ee0bd6aa90bd1f19bbb983d7d631f0c228fafde767e", "ja": "え～、ちょっとくらいいいって思うな。ほら見て？\nこの衣装、リボンもフリルもいっぱいなんだよ？", "zh": "诶——，我觉得稍微帮一下也没关系吧。你看？\n这套服装上有好多蝴蝶结和花边呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "d9106898b864bf0f4473dfafd28c5a332a1f1d2265437382a50637fa1ea3404a", "ja": "ミキひとりでがんばりすぎたせいで、\nシワとか出来ちゃったら大変なの。", "zh": "要是美希一个人太过努力，弄出皱褶来就糟糕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1016_p", "source_sha256": "df6a56049b61c0771a255d542a232f1dfcc9277d54e9c0b151dbd6b8f766f9f0", "ja": "うーん、そうだけど……どうしても無理なら、\n青羽さんでも呼んでこようか？", "zh": "嗯，是这样没错……但如果实在不行，要不要把青羽小姐叫来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "44e9c71ccd30c967ed87793c0ee2584223d88a55fa4e154ab5b100924a6f8982", "ja": "む～……、もういいの。\nじゃあミキ、脱ぐのやめるね。", "zh": "唔～……算了。\n那美希就不脱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "e95f0fbb1348a85e9f93aa12ea9eb7db8c9a30c161aa81f857304f20e450c150", "ja": "その代わり、チョコはハニーが食べさせて？\nミキ、ちゃんとこぼさないように食べるから♪", "zh": "作为交换，巧克力让亲爱的喂我吃，好不好？\n美希会好好吃，保证不洒出来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b6bb84e5c8569570a8e613d63d33d4238616024ffb3ea026918d596219b402b7", "ja": "まあ……それくらいは、しょうがないか。\nチョコは冷蔵庫だな？　とってくる。", "zh": "好吧……只是这点要求的话，也没办法呢。\n巧克力放在冰箱里对吧？我去拿来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "9a0490f8fccda6bd9d09c0d7aed04c144d43df7b448f082deee4ecec607a6245", "ja": "ありがとうなの～！\nスイッチ、オンオンオンってカンジ♪　あはっ☆", "zh": "谢谢啦～！\n感觉就像要把开关打开打开打开♪ 啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1021_p", "source_sha256": "13738f230bcd29207cfadea4a01223a8acc54e8a47c70239101efdecdb3847be", "ja": "いや待てよ？　でも、いつかは脱ぐんだから、\nやっぱり青羽さんを呼んだほうがいいような……。", "zh": "不对等等？但迟早都是要脱下来的，\n果然还是把青羽小姐叫来比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "87c0bdd3ae4e051220fa12c71defac2352817763a2ff540097768c2467a4d77e", "ja": "ミキ……もうダメなの……。\nはやくチョコ食べないと、もう……あふぅ。", "zh": "美希……已经不行了……。\n要是不赶紧吃巧克力，就要……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1023_p", "source_sha256": "586a897acdb378464a7db091f45654d5b1cf236b6bd3d4b40a06323393217ea7", "ja": "ああっ、そのまま寝たら、それこそシワに……！\nわかった、すぐとってくるから！", "zh": "啊，那样直接睡着的话，真的会长皱纹的……！\n知道了，我马上去拿过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "e77aa17fe478b1c7dadf600d42c50816d61ef6d5dbd831dbb6008af674fc394f", "ja": "うんっ♪\nあーんして、待ってるね。あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯♪\n张嘴等你哦。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0164_1025_p", "source_sha256": "026afd7ea013e24ca5b54580778a327c26c1006f54ded59e6e2f68b6b280c2e6", "ja": "（気のせいか、いつも以上に甘えてくるような……。\nはっ。さては、チョコだけに……？）", "zh": "（是不是错觉，她好像比平时更加爱撒娇了……。\n啊，难道是因为巧克力，所以变得更甜了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
